    "description": "Collection of 10 Lalique France crystal bird pieces in frosted and clear finishes. The assortment includes two larger Coquet bird figurines, an owl, several smaller bird figurines, a long-tailed bird, two small birds with black eyes and faceted clear bases, an owl-form dish, and a faceted clear crystal dish accented with two frosted birds.\nThe pair of larger birds retain original-style paper labels reading “COQUET 11.605,” and one photographed base is clearly engraved “Lalique  France.” Additional pieces in the collection show Lalique France signatures/markings.\nThe Coquet birds measure approximately 5 inches long, based on the ruler shown. Other pieces vary in size, with the overall collection ranging from small miniature birds to the larger owl and Coquet figures.\nThe pieces feature Lalique’s characteristic combination of satin-frosted surfaces, polished clear crystal and finely molded feather detailing. The clear faceted bird dish creates strong prismatic reflections. Only items shown with markings are verified as Lalique.\nCondition - Overall good displayed condition. Some pieces retain old paper labels, felt pads and/or adhesive residue on their bases. Light surface wear, scratches and marks may be present.\nPlease examine all photographs for individual condition and measurements.",
